<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Fighter Weapons</h1>
<p>The weapon skills the Fighters' guild of Midgaard teaches. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the weapon there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Some weapons also need strength or dexterity before you can practise them. Each weapon has its own help: help and the weapon's name.
</p>
<pre>Name             Level   Up to   Practising needs
Dagger               0   100%
Fist                 0   90%
Hand Axe             0   100%
Javelin              0   90%
Quarterstaff         0   100%
Sling                1   70%     dexterity 20
Short Sword          2   100%
Mace                 4   100%
Rapier               4   70%     dexterity 30
Club                 5   100%
Broad Sword          8   100%
Elbow                8   60%     dexterity 40
Falchion             8   100%
Whip                 9   60%     dexterity 50
Bow                 10   70%     dexterity 30
Sickle              10   70%     dexterity 40
Spear               10   100%
War Hammer          10   100%    strength 90
Brass Knuckles      12   80%
Kick Small          12   60%     dexterity 40
Kick Tiny           12   60%     dexterity 40
Adze Mattock        14   100%
Main Gauche         14   70%
Flail               15   100%    strength 32
Long Sword          15   100%
Battle Club         16   100%    strength 35
Scimitar            16   100%
Trident             16   70%     strength 20
Battle Mace         18   100%    strength 37
Bardiche            20   100%    strength 25
Crossbow            20   90%     dexterity 30
Morning Star        20   100%
Scythe              20   70%     strength 20
Lance               21   70%
Battle Axe          22   100%    strength 30
Maul                24   80%     strength 70
Claymore            25   100%    strength 30
Great Sword         25   100%    strength 30
War Mattock         25   100%    strength 26
Halberd             30   100%    strength 25
Knee                35   60%     dexterity 40
Stiletto            40   70%
